haan</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">: Kopi Kenangan</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;\">Kategori</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #4f46e5;\">: F&B / Pelayanan</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;\">Estimasi Gaji</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 500; color: #0f172a;\">: Rp 6.000.000 - Rp 8.500.000</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;\">Lokasi Penempatan</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 500; color: #334155;\">: Kuta, Bali</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 8px 0 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px dashed #e2e8f0;\">Status Tayang</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 8px 0 6px 0; font-weight: 800; color: #16a34a; border-top: 1px dashed #e2e8f0;\">: ACTIVE (Tayang)</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;\">Masa Kadaluarsa</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #e11d48;\">: s.d. 22 Agustus 2026 (30 Hari)</td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 14px;\">Silakan klik tombol di bawah untuk melihat tampilan lowongan kerja Anda di platform kami:</p>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost:3000\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25); transition: background-color 0.2s;\">Lihat Detail Lowongan</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"